Input: edt-ft5x06 - split the bus independent core from the I2C driver
Input: edt-ft5x06 - move the controller bring-up into a helper
Input: edt-ft5x06 - add an optional controller boot hook
Input: edt-ft5x06 - allow a chip specific touch data register
dt-bindings: input: touchscreen: edt-ft5x06: Add FocalTech FT8722
Input: edt-ft5x06 - add SPI transport and FT8722 support
Input: edt-ft5x06 - support following a DRM panel
dt-bindings: input: touchscreen: edt-ft5x06: Add FocalTech FT8009
Input: edt-ft5x06 - add FocalTech FT8009 support
Input: edt-ft5x06 - stop following the panel before devres starts

series charger
hold László Lajosházi's series and its fp3 fixes: their authors need contacting
iio: adc: qcom-spmi-adc5: add the BAT_THERM channel
dt-bindings: power: supply: qcom,pmi8998-charger: add the PMI632
power: supply: qcom_smbx: add support for the PMI632 charger
power: supply: qcom_smbx: program the JEITA limits from the battery
power: supply: qcom_smbx: expose the fast-charge current as a cooling device
power: supply: qcom_smbx: take the fast-charge current from the battery
power: supply: qcom_smbx: verify the battery ID before applying its limits
arm64: dts: qcom: pmi632: add the SMB5 charger
power: supply: qcom_smbx: gauge the battery from the PMIC's QG samples
power: supply: qcom_smbx: decode the charge status per generation
power: supply: qcom_smbx: only call a terminated charge full
power: supply: qcom_smbx: hold the pack full while the charger says it is
power: supply: qcom_smbx: restart a finished charge on pmi632
power: supply: qcom_smbx: do not read the OCV table while the charger drives
power: supply: qcom_smbx: correct the fuel gauge from rested readings only
arm64: dts: qcom: pmi632: wire the QG good-OCV interrupt
power: supply: qcom_smbx: complete the charge-end path and report more of it
arm64: dts: qcom: pmi632: describe the charger's interrupts, and fix one
power: supply: qcom_smbx: let the charger terminate a charge on SMB5
power: supply: qcom_smbx: do not forget a charge because the input blinked
power: supply: qcom_smbx: report how much charge the pack holds
dt-bindings: power: supply: battery: add id-resistor-ohms
dt-bindings: power: supply: qcom,pmi8998-charger: describe the charging policy
power: supply: qcom_smbx: read the charging policy from the charger node
dt-bindings: power: supply: drop the type refs the unit suffixes already imply
power: supply: qcom_smbx: learn what the pack actually holds
dt-bindings: power: supply: qcom,pmi8998-charger: Allow the PMI632's interrupts
